<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fair Isaac said raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fair Isaac said raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities raised its rating on Fair Isaac &amp; Co Inc to buy from hold, according to a Prudential source.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 2-1/4 in early trading to 38-1/2.</p>
</text>
